    "WHY THIS FILE IS DATA AND NOT ASSERTIONS IN THE TEST. The GenAI semantic",
    "conventions moved to a dedicated repository in June 2026, nothing in them is",
    "marked Stable, and the repository carries no tags, so there is no schema",
    "version to pin. A convention drift therefore arrives as a renamed field in a",
